DESCRIPTION:Originally from Wimberley\, Texas\, Sarah Jarosz is a six-time 
 GRAMMY Award winning singer\, songwriter and multi-instrumentalist. Since 
 her recorded debut in 2009\, she has released seven solo albums and two al
 bums with I’m With Her\, her band with Sara Watkins and Aoife O’Donova
 n. In addition to her multiple GRAMMY\, Americana Music Association\, and 
 Folk Alliance awards\, her work has received widespread critical praise fr
 om publications including Rolling Stone\, The New York Times\, and USA Tod
 ay. Jarosz has appeared three times on PBS’s legendary Austin City Limit
 s television show and numerous times on A Prairie Home Companion\, Live Fr
 om Here\, and the Grand Ole Opry. She is currently based in Nashville\, Te
 nnessee.\nhttps://theparlorroom.my.salesforce-sites.com/ticket/#/events/a0
