 c Award winner as Guitar Player of the Year (1997\, 1999\, 2014\, 2018)\, 
 most recently receiving the award on May 10\, 2018\, in Memphis. He has se
 rved as an Associate Professor of Guitar at Berklee College of Music and h
 as taught at the National Guitar summer workshop in Connecticut.\nhttps://
