SUMMARY:Member Discovery Series: Marianne Beaulieu
LOCATION:Iron Horse\, 18 Center St\, Northampton\, MA 01060
DESCRIPTION:with Arden Lloyd\nCurrently based out of her hometown of Montre
 al\, Marianne Beaulieu is an indie folk singer-songwriter whose goal has a
 lways been to bring comfort through her music. From the age of 5\, she sta
 rted learning the piano\, before taking singing classes in her teenage yea
 rs and teaching herself the guitar. She soon learns to use music as an out
 let and as a means to silence the world and sing her troubles away.\nhttps
 ://theparlorroom.my.salesforce-sites.com/ticket/#/events/a0SV500000CgYhVMA
 V\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
